message: "If you use these files, please cite them as below."
title: "Design Engineering Analytics with Power BI: free learner pack (Course 2, Engxtech, synthetic data)"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Yeddula
    given-names: Vijayakumar Reddy
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3998-500X"
abstract: >-
  Practice files for a free 20-video Power BI course for design and product
  engineers: a synthetic design-engineering dataset for the fictional company
  Engxtech (18-sheet workbook and 21 monthly change-log CSV exports), the
  finished Power BI files for every video, exercises with worked solutions, a
  formula cheat sheet and a capstone brief. All data are synthetic. Content is
  CC BY 4.0; the data-generator scripts are MIT.
keywords:
  - Power BI
  - DAX
  - Power Query
  - design engineering
  - engineering change management
  - bill of materials
  - tolerance stack-up
  - DFMEA
  - field ppm
  - synthetic data
  - open educational resource
repository-code: "https://github.com/VijayakumarYeddula/design-engineering-analytics-practice-files"
